<title>GREECE: IFC DRACHMA FRN DUE 99 COUPON SET AT 10.09PCT - LEADS.</title>
<headline>IFC DRACHMA FRN DUE 99 COUPON SET AT 10.09PCT - LEADS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The coupon on the 12.1 billion drachma FRN due 1999 issued by IFC was reset at 10.09 percent for the next interest period payable on October 31, 1997, joint lead managers Barclays Bank, Athens and National Bank of Greece said in a statement.</p>
<p>The coupon is based on six-month Athibor less 50 basis points, they said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
